  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1303.08 Notification Requirement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1303.08 Notification Requirement.\n\n(a) Any person, other than an employee of the department acting in their official capacity, who participates in any of the activities exempted pursuant to Env-Wq 1303.05 and Env-Wq 1303.07, shall notify the department prior to or within 24 hours after performing such activity, by calling 603-271-3503 and asking for the exotic species program.\n\n(b) Notification shall not be required for disposal after removal from recreational watercraft and equipment such as trailers, motors, fishing equipment, or diving gear.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300) #8703-A, eff 9-5-06; ss by #10696, eff 10-18-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300); ss by #14186, eff 1-25-25",
